Subject: [PATCH 500/505] Bind attention profiles to request and prefix-cache
 identity

Upstream base: spark-ds41f-1126 vLLM d8784b841c360f523ec20e44bf8fb0898f36d3e4.

Retain the 1017 artifact, FP32 dose, cache identity and OpenAI request validation. Reject concurrent GLP selection during admission and worker initialization. CPU coverage lives in the steering profile, identity and request suites.

Upstream status: downstream integration.
